Hedefin şu:

✔ VLAN 10 → VNI 10
✔ VLAN 20 → VNI 20
✔ L2 domain’ler ayrı
✔ L3 routing L3 VNI üzerinden (symmetric)

Aşağıda temiz, mantıklı ve standart bir EVPN-VXLAN tasarımı var.

🎯 TASARIM ÖZETİ (SENİN İSTEDİĞİN)
Katman	Leaf-A	Leaf-B
L2 VNI	VLAN10 → VNI10	VLAN20 → VNI20
L3 VNI	colspan=2 VNI 1000	
VRF	colspan=2 vrf-10	
EVPN	BGP EVPN	
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!CONFIG!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
🔹 VTEP-A (Leaf-1)
interface loopback0
 ip address 1.1.1.1/32

interface loopback1
 ip address 2.2.2.2/32

fabric anycast-gateway-mac 0011.2233.2016

vtep
 source loopback0
 arp suppress enable

VRF
ip vrf vrf-10
 rd 10:10
 route-target both 1000:1000

L2 – VLAN 10 → VNI 10
interface overlayrouter 10
 ip vrf binding vrf-10
 ip address 10.10.10.1/24
 anycast-gateway
 route-in-vni

vxlan 10
 extend-vlan 10
 router-interface overlayrouter 10
 arp suppress enable

L3 – Symmetric VXLAN (L3 VNI 1000)
interface overlayrouter 1000
 ip vrf binding vrf-10

vxlan 1000
 symmetric
 router-interface overlayrouter 1000

BGP EVPN
router-protocol bgp 64512
 bgp-instance router-id 2.2.2.2
 peer 3.3.3.3 remote-as 64512
 peer 3.3.3.3 update-source loopback1

 address-family-mode l2vpn evpn
  peer 3.3.3.3 activate

EVPN VNIs
evpn
 vni 10
  rd auto
  route-target both auto
 vni 1000
  rd auto
  route-target both auto

🔹 VTEP-B (Leaf-2)
interface loopback0
 ip address 4.4.4.4/32

interface loopback1
 ip address 3.3.3.3/32

fabric anycast-gateway-mac 0011.2233.2016

vtep
 source loopback0
 arp suppress enable

VRF
ip vrf vrf-10
 rd 10:10
 route-target both 1000:1000

L2 – VLAN 20 → VNI 20
interface overlayrouter 20
 ip vrf binding vrf-10
 ip address 10.20.20.1/24
 anycast-gateway
 route-in-vni

vxlan 20
 extend-vlan 20
 router-interface overlayrouter 20
 arp suppress enable

L3 – Symmetric VXLAN (L3 VNI 1000)
interface overlayrouter 1000
 ip vrf binding vrf-10

vxlan 1000
 symmetric
 router-interface overlayrouter 1000

BGP EVPN
router-protocol bgp 64512
 bgp-instance router-id 3.3.3.3
 peer 2.2.2.2 remote-as 64512
 peer 2.2.2.2 update-source loopback1

 address-family-mode l2vpn evpn
  peer 2.2.2.2 activate

EVPN VNIs
evpn
 vni 20
  rd auto
  route-target both auto
 vni 1000
  rd auto
  route-target both auto
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
🧠 BU TASARIMDA NE NETLEŞTİ?

✔ L2 domain = VNI (1:1)
✔ VLAN numarası ile VNI aynı → kafa karışmaz
✔ L2 subnet’ler ayrı
✔ Routing L3 VNI (1000) üzerinden
✔ Tam EVPN + Symmetric VXLAN best-practice

✅ SENİN SÖYLEDİĞİN MODEL ARTIK DOĞRU

“vxlan10 → vni10
vxlan20 → vni20 olmalı”

Bu aynı subnet değilse
ve L3 routing istiyorsan
%100 doğru tasarımdır.
